Arc Transcriber (the full backbone) downloads NVIDIA Parakeet-TDT 0.6B v2 (https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2,
CC-BY-4.0, Copyright (c) NVIDIA Corporation) at run time and uses its encoder unmodified; arc_audio/server.py loads the encoder
weights into the transformers ParakeetEncoder and re-implements its log-mel front end. The weights are not included here.
The optional transcript="parakeet" finals tier downloads the same model through NeMo at run time.

arc_audio/rescorer.py contains a fallback copy of the Metaphone function from jellyfish (https://github.com/jamesturk/jellyfish),
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2015 James Turk. It is used only when the jellyfish package is not installed.
